# NOTE: the Gradle wrapper (gradlew, gradlew.bat, gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar) is
# intentionally tracked, not ignored - GitHub Actions (and anyone else without Gradle
# globally installed) needs it to build the project. Previously these three lines
# excluded it, which meant `./gradlew` did not exist in the repo at all.
